<p class="toys-lead">Small live simulations and visual toys that run in the page, each one a tag of
its own - a file of <code>pad/subs/toys/types/</code> in the engine, written <code>{pad:open/}toy:name/{pad:close/}</code>. The server checks the options, a script in the page runs the toy: draw on
it, drag it, click it, change its sliders.</p>

<ul class="toys-cards">
  {array:toys}
    <li><a class="toys-card" href="?toys/{$toy}"><b>{$name}</b><span>{$line}</span><code>{pad:open/}{$toy}/{pad:close/}</code></a></li>
  {/array:toys}
</ul>
